gn. 3) The mirage could be confounded with generic off-distribution drift; we use random-direction and matched-non-motif-feature controls and test whether the mirage tracks motif-specific displacement. 4) Local and global structure are partly entangled (a large motif dominates the fold); the controlled dissociation pairs (step 5) separate them and we report where separation is impossible. 5) SAE quality/layer choice could confound Location; controlled with TopK and Ordered SAEs, multiple layers, raw-activation probes, and random-direction controls. 6) An internal consistency probe might not beat a black-box raw-activation probe on raw AUROC; the interpretability diagnosis (local-decodable, global-weakly-steerable) and the audit payoff remain the contributions, reported honestly. 7) If no mirage is found (local steering preserves global folds), that is a valuable positive result establishing that RNA-LM feature steering is thermodynamically safe.'}

